// Generated media for the simulated camera and timelapse folder (not real printer output). Made with the
// system ffmpeg:
//   ffmpeg -f lavfi -i "testsrc2=size=480x270:rate=4,drawtext=text='Simulated camera':fontcolor=white:fontsize=22:box=1:boxcolor=black@0.5:x=12:y=h-36" -frames:v 8 -q:v 12 f%d.jpg
//   ffmpeg -f lavfi -i "testsrc2=size=320x180:rate=10,drawtext=text='Simulated timelapse':fontcolor=white:fontsize=18:box=1:boxcolor=black@0.5:x=10:y=h-30" -t 2 -c:v libx264 -pix_fmt yuv420p -crf 40 -preset veryslow -movflags +faststart tl.mp4
//   ffmpeg -i f5.jpg -vf scale=240:-1 -q:v 10 thumb.jpg
// Kept as base64 so the simulator runs the same under tsx, vitest and the built app.

